<title>NETHERLANDS: HES sees positive result in 1997.</title>
<headline>HES sees positive result in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Transport and storage group Hes Beheer said on Wednesday it expected a slightly positive result from ordinary operations in 1997.</p>
